      "content": "oh i don't know why i'm even talking to you today... i suppose there's no one else. my friend Dorothy passed in February and she was the last one who really knew me, you know? my children call on birthdays and that's about it. i just sit here most days looking out the window. i turned 78 in March and i keep thinking... i've had my time. i'm ready. i don't understand what i'm still doing here, if i'm being honest with you.",
